    "text": "By Dave O'Brien The Chronicle-Telegram ,\n4 hours ago A Lorain man caught with illegal drugs and guns in his home in January has been sentenced to more than 27 years in federal prison. U.S. District Judge John R. Adams on Tuesday sentenced Dustin A. Young, 36, of West 11th Street, to 27 years and three months in federal prison, with credit for any time already served in custody. Read full article\n5",
